          "branch_id": "b3",
          "command": "southwest",
          "response": "\nStream Bank\nA slope descends to the noisy stream to the west. The old wooden bridge which \nspans it leans comfortably against the bank at your feet. To the east rises the \nflank of the hill, shining in the morning; two usable trails lead up around it, \nto the south and the northeast.\n\nA pair of large canvas bags lie at a narrow point on the path. One is rather \ndirty; the other has a tear along one seam, from which sand dribbles onto the \nground.\n\n>",
