          "response": "You take off the bracelet.\n\nMarie sits down against the wall, with a disgusted expression.\n\nThe handcuffs fall open. Marie appears surprised, but not too surprised to \nreact; she immediately pulls the handcuffs off fully and throws them on the \nground.\n\n[Your score has just gone up by three points.]\n\n[Score 112, up 3]\n>",
