          "response": "You squint, peering through the shadows. \"Mom?\"\n\nIt's your mother! What's she doing here?\n\n\"Heads up!\" shouts the wolf in your ear. \"Ha, ha, made you look!\"\n\nThe kitten skitters a little closer to you for protection.\n\nThe wolf yawns widely enough for you to count all his teeth.\n\nYour mother gathers you inside the circle of her arms and hugs until you can \nhardly breathe. Then she picks you up and twirls you around, skimming your feet \nover the floor as she whirls. She laughs out loud. \"You found me!\" When she \nputs you down again, you feel a little dizzy.\n\n[Your score has just gone up by five points.]\n\n Inside the Clock Tower            N           Score: 30\n                                   *    Out    Moves: 108\n[Score 30, up 5]\n>",
