        "notes": "# The Windhall Chronicles, Volume One: The Path to Fortune\n\nStory Z8 R5/960828. Local Z8 R5/960828 matches archive bytes and catalog. Paul J. Godfrey guide explicitly targets release 3, with no serial; preserve the two-release gap. Its work-around concerns a release-3 sleep bug and is not evidence that release 5 has that bug. Full Volume One guide reaches the final dragon route; no unavailable preview was selected.\n\nFollow the complete town, wizard trials, nymph, temple and hidden crossbow route through the final dragon confrontation and require the actual authored concluding narrative. The guide finishes the route at the dragon and then prints FULL/200 points; neither FULL, score alone nor ",
